# Gemma 3 (12B) tuned for the obsidian-llm-wiki / "Karpathy LLM Wiki" plugin.
# Google model, English-native -> no Chinese code-switching (unlike Qwen).
#
# NOTE: Gemma *4* on Ollama has NO 12B (only e2b/e4b, which are too small, and
#       26b/31b, which are too big for a 16GB card). Gemma 3 12B is the
#       right-sized Gemma for 16GB VRAM.
#
# Build:  ollama create gemma-wiki -f gemma-wiki.Modelfile
FROM gemma3:12b

# Long context -- THE key setting. The plugin never sends num_ctx, and Ollama
# otherwise defaults to a tiny ~4K window. 32768 is native + high quality and
# fits 16GB with headroom (~11GB total with q8_0 KV cache).
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

# Google's recommended Gemma sampling
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER min_p 0.0
